                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I have barely touched this game, but from the short time I have played it is obvious how much effort the developer put into the game.  The game is riddled with glaring spelling and grammar mistakes as well as overly simplified dialog.  I have already spotted no less than 7 of them and I am in the first area with monsters.  The UI is poorly designed as well.  Some buttons require you push only a small area of it (or outside it).  Their attempt to be more unique put them on the wrong path with their UI.  I will continue to play the game since I bought it.  If I see improvements I will update, but until then I do not recommend this game.  You can get better quality games for free.\n\nThere don't even have an option to close the program...",
